// docs/decomp_a10.md). Only the check translation unit and the offline harness (tools/a10_harness.cpp) include it. Made from
// typed_a9_check_rt.h by renaming (a9ck -> a10ck, A9_OFFLINE -> A10_OFFLINE, PS2X_A9_CHECK -> PS2X_A10_CHECK; A9's cores on the
// leg's logged memory kept, stage 10's functions call them; the typed runtime stubs as A7's) plus A10_NCHK's legs for the slot
// holders round A10 takes as their typed functions (the camera hook against the typed iosgluGetCameraContext and its note; the
// collision / cam126 natives against the lifted function on the native's entry state, every register and byte compared: the
// [a10hold] lines) and the recursion depths (A10_REC).
